# Mutation plan for crates/gotemplate (Go's text/template + html/template port).
#
#   MMRS_STACK_LOCKED=1 MUTATE_PACKAGE=gotemplate scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/gotemplate.plan
#
# The pkg suite touches no stack, so the stack lock is not needed. Each line moves one decision a
# reader could get wrong -- a context transition, the URL filter predicate, which escaper a
# context picks, comment stripping, the missing-key branch -- and the go_parity module (the
# oracle's 2,170 escaper cases, the text corpus and every Mattermost template) must see it. The
# last two lines are no-op controls.
